# construct-coverage.allow
# One export identifier per line, per package. Every entry needs the reason
# stated in its package's comment block below — an unreviewed allow-list
# defeats the coverage check the same way a stale hand-maintained index did.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.

# github-actions — Shape/Options/Result/detail types of an already-documented
# service or class (ActionCache, Artifact, BlobStore, CheckDocument, DryRun,
# GitHubMarkdown's table builder, ManagedDocument, OidcTokenIssuer,
# PackageManagerInstaller, ChildEnv, ToolInstaller); naming the parent is
# sufficient, the type alias needs no independent sentence.
ActionCacheShape
ActionLoggerShape
AnnotationProperties
ArtifactItem
ArtifactRef
ArtifactShape
Blob
BlobStoreShape
CheckDocumentOptions
CheckDocumentShape
CheckRunConclusion
DetachedSpawnOptions
DownloadOptions
DownloadResult
DryRunShape
ExtractOptions
GitHubHeadingDepth
GitHubListOptions
GitHubRowSchema
GitHubSchemaTableColumn
GitHubSchemaTableColumns
GitHubSchemaTableFormatRequiredKeys
GitHubSchemaTableFormattedColumn
GitHubSchemaTableOptions
ManagedDocumentSource
OidcClaims
OidcTokenIssuerShape
PackageManagerInstallerShape
PackageManagerInstallOptions
PathPrependOptions
ProvisionedFile
ProvisionFileOptions
ReadinessOptions
ToolDownloadOptions
ToolInstallerShape
UploadOptions
UploadResult
WithStepOptions

# github — Shape/Options/detail types of an already-documented resource
# service (GitBranch, GitCommit, GitHubApp, GitHubClient, GitHubCommit,
# GitHubContent, GitHubIssue, GitHubRelease, GitHubRepository, GitTag,
# PullRequestComment, PullRequest, WorkflowDispatch, ArtifactMetadata,
# Attestation, CheckRun, Rest); the octokit fixture-double helper type; the
# PermissionResult array-element types of the already-documented
# TokenPermissions comparator (ExtraPermission, PermissionGap).
ArtifactMetadataShape
AttestationShape
CheckRunShape
ExtraPermission
FileMode
FileStatus
GitBranchShape
GitCommitShape
GitHubAppOptions
GitHubClientOptions
GitHubClientShape
GitHubCommitShape
GitHubContentShape
GitHubFixtures
GitHubIssueShape
GitHubReleaseShape
GitHubRepositoryShape
GitTagShape
GraphQLErrorEntry
MergeMethod
PermissionGap
PullRequestCommentShape
PullRequestShape
RepositoryPatch
RestData
RestExtras
RestItem
RestPaginatingRoute
RestParams
RestResponse
WorkflowDispatchShape

# commands — detail types of already-documented Run/ToolDiscovery/LocalExec
# surfaces; REDACTED is the literal mask-string constant Redaction uses.
Launcher
REDACTED
ResolvedSource
ToolDiscoveryShape
ToolResolutionFailure

# npm — detail types/predicates of the already-documented DependencySpecifier
# and IntegrityHash brands, NpmRegistry's seeded-double value shape, and the
# Shape interface of the already-documented PackagePublish service.
ClassifiedSpecifier
IntegrityAlgorithm
isValidDependencySpecifier
isValidIntegrityHash
PackagePublishShape
SeededVersion

